      <button class="varty-product__arrow varty-product__arrow--right" type="button" data-varty-carousel-control="next" aria-label="Next Barista Unsweetened product image"></button>
    </div>
    <div class="varty-product__copy">
      <h2 id="varty-barista-title">Barista Unsweetened Oat Beverage Canada</h2>
      <p class="varty-product__intro">Whoever said oat beverages don’t froth, hasn’t tried Varty. In all fairness, oat beverages don’t normally froth. That’s why we added less than 1% of organic, locally-sourced high oleic sunflower oil, rich in monosaturated fats, which helps to stabilize the foam and create a denser, more velvety texture. Made with just 4 simple ingredients, this organic oat beverage is carefully crafted to froth like a coffee-lover’s dream – sealing your cup of Joe with a velvety finish every time.</p>
      <ul class="varty-product__badges">
        <li>100% Certified Organic</li>
        <li>No added sugar</li>
        <li>Barista-Approved</li>
        <li>Unsweetened for Pure Taste</li>
        <li>Ultra-Creamy &amp; Smooth</li>
        <li>Cleanest Barista on the market</li>
      </ul>
      <details open>
        <summary>4 Ingredients</summary>
        <div class="varty-product__panel">
          <ul class="varty-product__list">
            <li>Filtered Water</li>
            <li>Organic Canadian Oats</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="varty-product__intro">Contains less than 1%:</p>
          <ul class="varty-product__list">
            <li>Organic High-Oleic Sunflower Oil</li>
            <li>Potassium Carbonate</li>
            <li>…That’s It.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Perfect for</summary>
        <div class="varty-product__panel">
          <ul class="varty-product__list">
            <li>Lattes</li>
            <li>Cappuccinos</li>
            <li>Iced Coffee</li>
            <li>Espresso</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="varty-products__testimonials" aria-label="Varty customer testimonials">
    <article class="varty-products__quote">
      <span class="varty-products__quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">”</span>
      <p>This oat milk is unbelievably smooth and delicious. I’ve been adding it to my morning coffee, and it makes every cup taste like a treat!</p>
      <cite>Jess Smith</cite>
